sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>UsersPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewUserAccountBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewUserAccountController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: view an account
  UI->>B: GET /api/admin/users/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer userId)
  C->>User: findById()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: AdminUserResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result